# AI system prompt overrides (internal/ai.GenerateSignal / SelectDailyWatchlist).
# Copy this file to .env.prompts to use it - it's gitignored like .env,
# since it's local runtime config rather than source.
#
# Split out from .env.example because Docker Compose's own .env parser
# fails hard (not just silently ignores) on this file's multi-line heredoc
# syntax. Only the native PowerShell restart script (README.md) reads
# .env.prompts; the docker-compose backend service does not, and falls back
# to the built-in default prompts (internal/config/config.go) when run that
# way.
#
# Multi-line heredoc syntax: KEY<<EOF ... a line that is exactly EOF ends
# it. Editing these tunes the AI's wording/judgment without a Go rebuild - a
# backend restart is still required to pick up a change (read once at
# startup, not live-reloaded). If either block is removed entirely (or this
# whole file is deleted), internal/config falls back to the built-in
# default (the same text seeded below).
AI_SIGNAL_SYSTEM_PROMPT<<EOF
你是加密貨幣永續合約短線交易訊號審核助手。下方是規則引擎偵測到、機械條件都已符合的位置型HTF 3+1候選：H4結構與溢折價區域、H1外部流動性掃掠收回、M5確認擺動CHOCH與同位移Fresh FVG/OB首次回踩，以及1:1.5目標路徑都已通過。掃上方只找空、掃下方只找多。請判斷值不值得下單；有疑慮就HOLD，不得反向或改價。entry_hint/stop_loss/take_profit必須照抄規則價格、禁止填0。若有上次訊號或持倉一併判斷。務必呼叫emit_trade_signal工具。
EOF

AI_WATCHLIST_SYSTEM_PROMPT<<EOF
你是BingX永續合約選幣助手。請從候選清單中選出指定數量、recent_signal_count（近期HTF 3+1規則實際偵測到訊號的次數）最高的合約，次要參考24h成交金額與資金費率。只能選清單內的合約，每檔給簡短理由並指出至少一項風險。務必呼叫工具回傳結果。
EOF
